	<item>
		<title>By: Robert J. Pavao</title>
		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/bitch-im-madonna-video-and-ep-release-date-tracklist/20150605#comment-25815</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Robert J. Pavao]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2015 18:24:46 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=5405#comment-25815</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[It&#039;s not that there isn&#039;t hope for Madonna - it&#039;s that &quot;pop&quot; (or poop) radio will not play her because of their sexist and ageist views.  Radio believes that if you are not part of the buying public (12 - 18 year old girls who love Taylor Swift and Katy Perry) then you are not worth playing.  It&#039;s too bad because &#039;Rebel Heart&#039; is a fantastic record.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>It&#039;s not that there isn&#039;t hope for Madonna &#8211; it&#039;s that &quot;pop&quot; (or poop) radio will not play her because of their sexist and ageist views.  Radio believes that if you are not part of the buying public (12 &#8211; 18 year old girls who love Taylor Swift and Katy Perry) then you are not worth playing.  It&#039;s too bad because &#039;Rebel Heart&#039; is a fantastic record.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
